{
  "name": "GD·01 Find · sort replies",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## GD·01 Replies (Boss 5 · D3)\nGmail Trigger on the outreach inbox. STOP is caught by a rule first (no AI needed); then a Text Classifier: interested, not now, stop, out of office, bounce, other.\nSTOP and bounces → suppression (all channels, forever). Interested → GD·08 CRM upsert + Telegram to Tolu with the booking link.\n\n**Credentials:** Gmail (outreach mailbox), Postgres, OpenAI, Telegram.\n**Replace:** YOUR_GD08_WORKFLOW_ID, YOUR_BOOKING_LINK, YOUR_TELEGRAM_CHAT_ID, YOUR_MODEL.",
        "height": 300,
        "width": 400
      },
      "id": "d7e40a4c-e88c-41b1-a065-c2b9a408ba96",
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -528,
        -288
      ]
    },
